cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Truewise data or code, please cite it as below."
title: "Truewise: open US college program value data from the College Scorecard"
abstract: >-
  A clean, joined, reproducible dataset and toolkit derived from public U.S. federal
  education data (Department of Education College Scorecard, plus BLS and CRDC), including
  the federal earnings-premium test that flags college programs whose graduates earn less
  than a typical high-school graduate.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Anandraj
    website: "https://ndranandraj.com"
url: "https://truewise.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ndranandraj/truewise"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-07-17"
keywords:
  - college-scorecard
  - education-data
  - open-data
  - higher-education
  - earnings-premium
  - civic-tech
